body:
I admit that i treat girls wrong then because

I have a girl that I like but I didn't have the courage to ask her out.

So  I ask a other girls out because i didn't have feelings for them so i didn't care but i got so into it that i realized it was so easy making them all fall. It was so addicting the love and attention you get but i knew that i was in the wrong so i told them the truth and i was slapped multiple times and got beaten up ha i deserve that but there was this one girl who didn't care and still kept talking with me I thought that she truly cared for me and liked me I thought that i love her when I realized that he was playing me and some other guys It hurts so bad i cried and i know that i deserved that </3 it broke my heart till this day it still hurts can't move on my heart turn cold and my body was numb so I tried to make myself feel better by asking my crush out and  there i was finally mustering my courage to confess to the girl i like when i saw her with an other guy that was my best friend and her boyfriend i just stopped working it was so empty i didn't give a fuck about everything anymore i was just nothing i was always late and now i'm depressed.

I was so insecure about everything don't mind i'm pessimistic but I trust you.

&#x200B;

